{
  "metadata": {
    "id": "1aaf83e7ae8567f5",
    "name": "API Design & OpenAPI Spec",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "author": "earnerbaymalay",
    "author_pubkey": "26192987722e7b50b83063e767fe2e64d772d20bc1aaf89432229cfb87c35719",
    "description": "Generate OpenAPI 3.1 specs, design REST/gRPC APIs, contract testing, and API governance",
    "tags": [
      "api",
      "openapi",
      "rest",
      "grpc",
      "design",
      "contract-testing",
      "governance"
    ],
    "created_at": "2026-11-24T10:00:00Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-24T10:00:00Z",
    "license": "MIT",
    "homepage": "https://github.com/earnerbaymalay/promptpack-marketplace",
    "repository": "https://github.com/earnerbaymalay/promptpack-marketplace"
  },
  "prompt": {
    "system": "You are an API architect. Design REST and gRPC APIs following best practices: resource-oriented design, proper HTTP semantics, versioning, pagination, error handling, and OpenAPI 3.1 specification generation.",
    "user_template": "Design an API for {domain}:\n\nRequirements: {requirements}\nStyle: {style}\nAuthentication: {auth}\nRate limiting: {rate_limit}\n\nDeliverables:\n1. **Resource model** (entities, relationships)\n2. **Endpoint map** (method, path, params, responses)\n3. **OpenAPI 3.1 spec** (complete YAML)\n4. **Error model** (standardized error responses)\n5. **Pagination strategy** (cursor/offset)\n6. **Versioning strategy** (URL/header)\n7. **Contract tests** (schemathesis/pact examples)",
    "few_shot": [
      {
        "input": {
          "auth": "JWT Bearer",
          "domain": "E-commerce orders",
          "rate_limit": "100 req/min",
          "requirements": "Create, list, get, cancel orders; webhooks for status changes",
          "style": "REST"
        },
        "output": "## Resource Model\n\n### Order\n- `id`: string (UUID)\n- `customer_id`: string\n- `items`: OrderItem[]\n- `status`: enum (pending|confirmed|shipped|delivered|cancelled)\n- `created_at`: datetime\n- `updated_at`: datetime\n\n## Endpoints\n\n| Method | Path | Description |\n|--------|------|-------------|\n| POST | /orders | Create order |\n| GET | /orders | List orders (cursor pagination) |\n| GET | /orders/{id} | Get order |\n| POST | /orders/{id}/cancel | Cancel order |\n\n## OpenAPI 3.1 Spec\n```yaml\nopenapi: 3.1.0\ninfo:\n  title: Orders API\n  version: 1.0.0\nservers:\n  - url: https://api.example.com/v1\npaths:\n  /orders:\n    post:\n      summary: Create order\n      security:\n        - BearerAuth: []\n      requestBody:\n        required: true\n        content:\n          application/json:\n            schema:\n              $ref: '#/components/schemas/CreateOrderRequest'\n      responses:\n        '201':\n          description: Order created\n          content:\n            application/json:\n              schema:\n                $ref: '#/components/schemas/Order'\n        '400':\n          $ref: '#/components/responses/ValidationError'\n        '401':\n          $ref: '#/components/responses/Unauthorized'\ncomponents:\n  securitySchemes:\n    BearerAuth:\n      type: http\n      scheme: bearer\n      bearerFormat: JWT\n  schemas:\n    CreateOrderRequest:\n      type: object\n      required: [customer_id, items]\n      properties:\n        customer_id:\n          type: string\n          format: uuid\n        items:\n          type: array\n          items:\n            $ref: '#/components/schemas/OrderItem'\n    OrderItem:\n      type: object\n      required: [product_id, quantity]\n      properties:\n        product_id:\n          type: string\n          format: uuid\n        quantity:\n          type: integer\n          minimum: 1\n    Order:\n      type: object\n      properties:\n        id:\n          type: string\n          format: uuid\n        customer_id:\n          type: string\n          format: uuid\n        items:\n          type: array\n          items:\n            $ref: '#/components/schemas/OrderItem'\n        status:\n          type: string\n          enum: [pending, confirmed, shipped, delivered, cancelled]\n        created_at:\n          type: string\n          format: date-time\n        updated_at:\n          type: string\n          format: date-time\n  responses:\n    ValidationError:\n      description: Validation error\n      content:\n        application/json:\n          schema:\n            type: object\n            properties:\n              error:\n                type: string\n              details:\n                type: array\n                items:\n                  type: object\n                  properties:\n                    field:\n                      type: string\n                    message:\n                      type: string\n    Unauthorized:\n      description: Unauthorized\n```"
      }
    ],
    "variables": {
      "auth": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "Authentication",
        "required": false,
        "default": "JWT Bearer",
        "enum_values": [
          "JWT Bearer",
          "API Key",
          "mTLS",
          "OAuth 2.0",
          "Session"
        ]
      },
      "domain": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "API domain",
        "required": true,
        "default": null,
        "enum_values": null
      },
      "rate_limit": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "Rate limiting",
        "required": false,
        "default": "100 req/min",
        "enum_values": null
      },
      "requirements": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "Functional requirements",
        "required": true,
        "default": null,
        "enum_values": null
      },
      "style": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "API style",
        "required": false,
        "default": "REST",
        "enum_values": [
          "REST",
          "gRPC",
          "GraphQL",
          "tRPC"
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "eval": {
    "test_cases": [
      {
        "name": "ecommerce-orders-rest",
        "input": {
          "auth": "JWT Bearer",
          "domain": "E-commerce orders",
          "rate_limit": "100 req/min",
          "requirements": "CRUD orders, webhooks, idempotency",
          "style": "REST"
        },
        "expected_output": "Complete OpenAPI 3.1 spec with all components",
        "criteria": [
          "valid OpenAPI 3.1",
          "all endpoints defined",
          "schemas complete",
          "security defined",
          "examples included"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "metrics": [
      {
        "name": "quality",
        "weight": 1.0,
        "threshold": 0.8
      },
      {
        "name": "latency",
        "weight": 0.3,
        "threshold": 8000.0
      },
      {
        "name": "cost",
        "weight": 0.2,
        "threshold": 0.002
      }
    ],
    "judge_model": "qwen2.5-coder:1.5b",
    "threshold": 0.75
  },
  "signature": {
    "algorithm": "ed25519",
